    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d464">

                <pb facs="0773" n="755" xml:id="pg755"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.48 FAA/12–3047: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Embassy in Italy
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-12-30T19:00:00-05:00">December 30,
                            1947—7 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2735. Mefa 3. Subject: Additional publicity
                    Interim Aid.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Enabling legislation interim aid is Public Law 389 of Dec. 17 entitled
                        “Foreign Aid Act of 1947”.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d464-f1"/> Appropriation
                        legislation is Public Law 393 of Dec. 23 entitled “Third Supplemental
                        Appropriation Act, 1948” for fiscal year ending June 30, 1948.<anchor n="2"
                            xml:id="d464-f2"/>
                    </item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Use words “United States Foreign Aid Program” as official designation.
                        Abbreviation is USFAP, but please use
                            PL 389 in addition in cables to clearly
                        distinguish from USFRP, PL 84.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Following is initial portion supply program for Italy approved by Dept
                        under USFAP, PL 389. Procurement will be initiated on signature
                        agreement.</item>
                </list>
                <table cols="3" rows="15">
                    <row role="label">
                        <cell>Product</cell>
                        <cell>Quantity</cell>
                        <cell>Estimated CIF Value</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>(<hi rendition="#italic">Long tons</hi>)</cell>
                        <cell>(<hi rendition="#italic">Dollars</hi>)</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Cereals</cell>
                        <cell role="num">152,000</cell>
                        <cell role="num">22,000</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Soya Flour</cell>
                        <cell role="num">2,000</cell>
                        <cell role="num">360</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Pulses (U.S.)</cell>
                        <cell role="num">4,000</cell>
                        <cell role="num">1,244</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Rolled Oats</cell>
                        <cell role="num">3,000</cell>
                        <cell role="num">918</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Coal (U.S.)</cell>
                        <cell role="num">600,000</cell>
                        <cell role="num">12,000</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell><anchor n="*" xml:id="d464-f3"/>Coal (Ruhr)</cell>
                        <cell role="num">256,000</cell>
                        <cell role="num">5,500</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Aviation gasoline</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">300</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>
                            POL from various countries</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">6,800</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Blister copper from Chile</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">4,100</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Phosphate rocks</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">2,200</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Nitrates from Chile</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">1,000</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Medical supplies</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">600</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Total</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">57,022</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <list>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Desirable that publicity covering this initial program be released when
                        agreement signed.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d464-f4"/> Send urgently substance ur
                        press release for use in preparation simultaneous release here on signature
                        of agreement.</item>
                    <pb facs="0774" n="756" xml:id="pg756"/>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>This message supplemental to request for publicity contained Deptel 2678, Dec. 20, Mefa 1, on agreement itself.<anchor n="4"
                            xml:id="d464-f5"/> Suggest single release covering (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">a</hi>) agreement and purposes program as a whole
                            (<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>) initial portion program set forth para
                        3 above.</item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d464-f1" n="1" xml:id="d464-f1-content">
                <p>61 Stat. 934.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d464-f2" n="2" xml:id="d464-f2-content">
                <p>61 Stat. 941.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d464-f3" n="*" xml:id="d464-f3-content">
                <p>December and January shipments.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d464-f4" n="3" xml:id="d464-f4-content">
                <p>The Department’s telegraphic instruction 2732, December 30, not printed,
                    forwarded the text of the agreement which the Ambassador was authorized to sign
                    (800.48 FAA/12–3047). For the text of the new agreement signed at Rome on
                    January 3, 1948, see Department of State, Treaties and Other International Acts
                    Series (TIAS) No. 167S, or 62 Stat. (pt. 2)
                    1807.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d464-f5" n="4" xml:id="d464-f5-content">
                <p>This telegraphic instruction, not printed, forwarded to Rome the initial draft of
                    the proposed new agreement (800.48 FAA/12–2047).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
